  - TypeFullName: 
    MemberName: HandleBundleAndMetaLoading
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 4
    ParamNames:
    - wrapper
    - report
    - cancellationToken
    - BasisProgressReport(
    ParamDocs:
    - "Whether a stale entry should be deleted outright rather than merely bypassed. True for the\n full load, where eviction reclaims the previous UniqueVersion's files instead of leaving\n them for the LRU sweep. False for the connector-only load: its caller treats \"no meta on\n disc\" as a corrupt item and REMOVES the user's library key, so deleting the entry there would turn\n a failed re-download into silent loss of the user's saved item. Bypassing still refreshes \u2014\n the re-download rewrites the entry \u2014 it just leaves the old payload for the LRU sweep."
    - 
    - 
    - 
