    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The single decision that lets content published to a STATIC url ever be updated: whether a\n cache entry found by url is also current for the version the requester asked for.\n\n \n\nReturns true (keep using the cache) whenever no version was declared, which is the\n branch taken by every bundle and client that predates versioning \u2014 so this is a no-op for\n existing content.\n\n\n\nA mismatched requested tag alone is NOT proof the cache is stale \u2014 the claim can be\n the stale side (see HostConfirmsCachedCopyCurrentAsync), so a mismatch asks\n the host before anything is evicted."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
