    Summary: "Marks a stored tag as having come from `Last-Modified` rather than an `ETag`, so it\n can be turned back into the right conditional request header. Tags are stored VERBATIM\n otherwise (quotes and weak markers intact) because `If-None-Match` must echo the\n server's exact spelling; normalization happens only when comparing."
