    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Sentinel parked in _requestedTimes by TryClaimUnload. Reaching\n zero is not enough to unload: the old code re-read the count and then called Unload(true),\n so an Increment landing in that gap got a reservation on a bundle whose assets were about to\n be destroyed. Claiming the count instead makes \"nobody holds this\" and \"nobody may take it\"\n one atomic step, and Increment refuses once the claim is in."
    Remarks: 
