    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Recognises a Fake-IP resolver on this machine. Clash and sing-box in TUN mode answer every\n DNS query with a synthetic address out of the RFC 2544 benchmarking range and map it back to\n the real domain inside the proxy, so an ordinary public CDN host looks non-global-unicast to\n BasisUrlSecurity.ValidateResolvedHostAsync and every download is refused.\n\n \n\nThis is a diagnostic, never a permission. Nothing here can open a range: the\n gate is opened only by BasisUrlSecurity.AllowBenchmarkRangeFromDns, which the\n player sets. All this decides is whether it is worth offering them that switch, so a false\n negative costs an unprompted player (who can still find the setting) and a false positive\n costs one declined dialog."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
