  - TypeFullName: 
    MemberName: CalculateObliqueMatrix
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 2
    ParamNames:
    - projection
    - ObliqueDotEpsilon
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Calculates an oblique projection matrix. Gated on the dot product's own conditioning, not\n eye-to-plane distance: near-grazing/view-parallel geometry collapses the dot term and the\n matrix explodes (Adreno GPU hangs). An Approximately(0) check misses near-zero-but-not-zero,\n so anything inside the epsilon renders without the clip \u2014 objects behind the plane can peek\n for a frame at extreme grazing angles, which beats a device freeze."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
