  - TypeFullName: BasisAvatarModelCache
    MemberName: BasisAvatarModelCache
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 1
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Centralized per-avatar-model runtime cache. Data that is deterministic for a given\n humanoid Avatar asset (T-pose rotations, hand pose grids, calibration coords) is\n stored here so that loading the same avatar a second time \u2014 whether for the local\n player switching back, or multiple remote players sharing the same model \u2014 skips\n the expensive bake/capture work and copies from cache instead.\n\n Cache key: `Animator.avatar.GetEntityId()` \u2014 unique per loaded Avatar asset,\n stable across instances of the same model within a session.\n\n Subsystems store their data in typed slots on Entry. A null slot means\n \"not yet cached\"; subsystems populate their slot after the first computation and\n read from it on subsequent loads."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
