    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The Avatar asset this entry describes, held so lookups can prove the entry still\n belongs to it. Two things make that necessary: the asset dies when its AssetBundle is\n unloaded, and an entity id is only unique among LIVE objects \u2014 a later asset can be\n handed the id of a destroyed one. Without the check a reused id would serve a\n different avatar someone else's rest pose, which is a silent, small,\n everywhere-at-once error rather than a visible failure."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
