    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Authored bind localPositions of the bones the networked body fit scales, indexed to match\n `BasisBodyFitApply.CollectBones`."
    Remarks: "Caching this is not only a saving \u2014 it removes a drift hazard. The live capture re-read\n `bone.localPosition` on every calibration, so a recalibration of an avatar that\n already had a fit applied would record the SCALED positions as \"rest\" and compound the fit\n on the next apply. An authored copy taken once cannot drift."
    Returns: 
