    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Clears all cached data and frees the native buffers. Runs when play mode starts, when the\n application quits (in the Editor: when play mode stops), before every assembly reload in\n the Editor, and once the Editor is back in edit mode. The reload hook is what a script edit\n during play needs: the domain goes away without ever leaving play mode, and the statics\n holding HandPoseGridData.SharedCells die with it while the Persistent memory\n does not."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
