    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Pure, side-effect-free constellation classifier: the tracker\u2192role matching math\n extracted out of BasisAvatarIKStageCalibration so it can be driven by\n synthetic data (the editor Tracker Placement Sweep) as well as by live devices. It\n takes a set of trackers described only by their body-relative height/lateral ratios and\n returns a role per tracker \u2014 no avatar lookup, no device mutation, no settings reads.\n The live calibration builds these samples from real devices, calls Classify, then applies\n the returned roles; the sweep generates them from body archetypes and checks the result."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
