    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Which stack a panel sits in. Every panel is its own root world-space canvas, and canvases\n sharing a sorting order fall back to sorting by distance from the camera \u2014 which is why a\n dialogue could come up behind the page that raised it, or the hotbar disappear behind a\n page opened from it. Higher draws later, so higher draws on top.\n \n\n\n The gaps are deliberate: a nested canvas that overrides its sorting can be slotted between\n two tiers without renumbering the ones either side of it."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
