    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Lets downloads proceed when the system resolver answers with an address in the RFC 2544\n benchmarking range (198.18.0.0/15). Off by default. Fake-IP proxies (Clash, sing-box in\n TUN mode) hand every domain a synthetic address out of that range and carry the\n connection themselves, so the security gate that blocks non-routable addresses refuses\n every file. Only that one range is affected \u2014 loopback, LAN and cloud-metadata\n addresses stay blocked with this on."
    Remarks: 
