  - TypeFullName: BasisTransformAudit
    MemberName: BasisTransformAudit
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 1
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Counts what goes through BasisTransformAccess, keyed by call site.\n\n The point is coverage, not precision: a Transform read that does not route through the funnel is\n invisible here, so a site missing from this list means either it does not run or it was never\n migrated. Treat the list as the map of what is known, and the profiler as the check on what is not.\n\n Off by default. Recording costs a dictionary lookup per operation, which is far more than the\n Transform read it is measuring \u2014 this is a hunting tool, not something to leave armed. The whole\n class compiles out of player builds."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
