  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Drivers.BasisRenderCaptureAutomation
    MemberName: BasisRenderCaptureAutomation
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 1
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "CLI-driven, fully unattended render-pass capture for a standalone Player \u2014 no in-game UI click\n needed. Inert unless --render-capture-frames is present on the command line. Flags:\n   --render-capture-frames[=N]        enables automation; N defaults to BasisRenderProfileHistory.DefaultFrames\n   --render-capture-connect=host:port  connects before capturing (skips BasisDeepLinkProvider's\n                                       confirmation dialog, which can't be automated)\n   --render-capture-gi-quality=Tier    Low/Medium/High/Ultra, applied to\n                                       BasisGlobalIlluminationSettings.Current.quality before capture\n   --render-capture-rtao-quality=Tier  Low/Medium/High/Ultra, applied via\n                                       BasisRTAOFeature.HasQualityOverride/QualityOverride\n Always self-terminates (Application.Quit) once the capture is written, so it never idles\n connected to a real server."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
