  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.BasisSdk.Highlight.BasisHighlightOverride
    MemberName: BasisHighlightOverride
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: MonoBehaviour
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Per-renderer authoring for the BasisHighlight feature. Drop this on a\n GameObject with a Renderer to control how that renderer is drawn into the\n highlight mask when something highlights it via BasisHighlightManager:\n \n- BasisHighlightOverrideType.None \u2013 use the feature's\n   default/fallback mask (identical to having no component).\n- BasisHighlightOverrideType.Material \u2013 draw with\n   MaskMaterial, a silhouette shader matching this renderer's\n   geometry (e.g. one that reproduces a vertex deform so the outline lines up).\n- BasisHighlightOverrideType.Exclude \u2013 never highlight\n   this renderer, even while it is in the active set.\n\n The mode and material are inspector-serialized and also mutable at runtime\n via OverrideType / MaskMaterial; their setters\n re-register with the manager so the next frame's mask reflects the change.\n The renderer is cached in OnValidate so registration never\n reaches for GetComponent and stale references can't outlive the prefab."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.BasisSdk.Highlight.BasisHighlightPass
    MemberName: BasisHighlightPass
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: ScriptableRenderPass
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 1
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "RenderGraph pass implementation for BasisHighlight:\n   1. Mask     \u2014 draw every active renderer with its override material into\n                 a half-res R8 silhouette texture.\n   2. Dilate   \u2014 separable H/V max filter that grows the silhouette by N\n                 pixels. (dilated \u2212 raw) is the outline ring; because max\n                 filtering produces a constant-thickness band, the ring\n                 exactly follows the contour, including concave corners\n                 (no gaussian iso-line \"skipping\" across nub junctions).\n   3. Glow     \u2014 optional separable gaussian on the dilated mask, used as\n                 the soft halo trailing outward from the silhouette.\n   4. Composite \u2014 combine raw, dilated, and glow into a ring + halo and\n                 alpha-blend over camera color."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
