  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Networking.NetworkedAvatar.BasisAvatarBufferPool
    MemberName: BasisAvatarBufferPool
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Thread-safe pool for BasisAvatarBuffer.\n - Single reset per round-trip: buffers are reset on Get(), NOT on Release().\n - Editor/Dev-only invariants enforced with UnityEngine.Assertions.\n - The list is guarded by a monitor rather than a CAS on the head. The lock-free form was a\n   Treiber stack with no version tag: a pop that read head/head.NextInPool and was then\n   preempted while another thread popped both and pushed the first back had its CAS succeed\n   against the recycled head and installed a CHECKED-OUT buffer as the list head. That hands\n   one buffer to two receivers, orphans the rest of the free list, and lets Deinitialize\n   Dispose() the persistent NativeArrays of a buffer a Burst job still reads."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
