    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Admin: set the server avatar-reduction (BSR) tuning. Persisted to config.xml, re-applied live,\n and broadcast to every admin panel. SlowestSendRate only affects clients that join afterwards."
    Remarks: "The four hybrid-codec arguments are optional and default to \"leave as-is\": null sends back\n whatever the server last pushed. The admin panel has no controls for them yet, and a caller\n that does not know about a setting must not be able to silently reset it \u2014 the wire message\n carries the whole block, so omitting a field is not an option at this layer."
    Returns: 
