    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Writes pre-computed eye localRotations to the receivers' eye Transforms on\n worker threads. Iterates a TransformAccessArray built once\n per change-of-membership; pairs (2 transforms per eye-having slot) are\n laid out [L0, R0, L1, R1, \u2026] so `index >> 1` recovers the pair\n and `index & 1` picks left vs. right. Per-pair the slot in the\n underlying NativeArrays comes from pairToSlot; OverrideEye\n slots are skipped here so Apply can run the legacy main-thread path."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
