    IsMemberConst: 1
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Largest clipboard payload that will be copied out of shared memory. Deliberately generous \u2014\n an uncompressed bitmap of a 4K screen is already 33 MB \u2014 because the subscriber applies the\n real limits and can explain them; this only stops an absurd allocation from being attempted\n at all. The blob never reaches the network: subscribers re-encode before sharing anything."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
