  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Rendering.
    MemberName: AcceptsCamera
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - BasisLocalCameraDriver.CameraInstance)
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The acceleration structure global illumination is already tracing, when it holds everything\n ambient occlusion asked for.\n\n Both effects trace the same avatars and the same world, and building that twice a frame - two\n scans of the scene, two transform sweeps, two builds, two copies of every avatar's capsules -\n is the single largest thing they duplicate. Sharing costs nothing in fidelity: the instances\n carry a category mask and each effect's rays only walk the half it asked for.\n\n Only ever borrowed, never widened. If global illumination is tracing a narrower set than\n occlusion wants - the player asked for World + Avatars here and Avatars there - the structure\n simply does not contain the geometry, and no mask can add it back, so occlusion keeps its own."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
