    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Connector fetches shared per bee URL: N wearers of one avatar await ONE ranged\n download instead of racing N tasks through the gate. The old per-player fetches each\n started a 30s budget that also covered the QUEUE \u2014 in a same-avatar lobby everyone\n past the first gate-width waited out their budget behind identical downloads and got\n cancelled. Completed successes stay cached so later wearers capture instantly;\n failures are evicted so the tick's per-player backoff retries with a fresh fetch.\n Main-thread access only."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
