    Summary: "Re-applies the persisted BasisSettingsDefaults.EnableStreamingMeta\n value once settings have been loaded from disk. Called by\n BasisSettingsDefaults.LoadAll."
    Remarks: "Bootstrap runs at RuntimeInitializeLoadType.AfterSceneLoad,\n which is before BasisSettingsDefaults.LoadAll populates the bindings, so\n the initial OnEnable read sees the construction-time default (off) and\n BasisSettingsBinding{T}.LoadBindingValue writes the loaded value without\n firing `OnChanged`. Without this re-apply the listener would only come up after a\n manual toggle \u2014 not on startup when the user already had it enabled."
