    Summary: Delay in seconds between repeated move actions while move is actuated.
    Remarks: "While move is being held down, the input module will first wait for moveRepeatDelay seconds\n after the first actuation of move and then trigger a move event every moveRepeatRate seconds.\n\n Note that a maximum of one AxisEventData will be sent per frame. This means that even if multiple time\n increments of the repeat delay have passed since the last update, only one move repeat event will be generated."
