    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Hands one wearer's reference back. It has to be a wearer of THIS entry: releases arrive\n keyed by a version string, and an instance stranded on an entry that was evicted and rebuilt\n under the same key (see IsSharedUsable) would otherwise retire the rebuilt\n version out from under its live wearers, while a wearer that already left would retire it a\n second time. Both landed on the drain as \"queued with wearers still live\". A release from\n anything this entry does not hold is now nothing at all."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
