    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The one copy of the grid interpolation. Kept as a free-standing static class so a Burst job\n can call it without touching the managed grid object that owns the cells.\n\n Local and remote MUST reconstruct through this same function. Two consequences if they don't:\n the hand a player sees on themselves stops matching the hand everyone else sees, and the\n remote apply path's write mask \u2014 which skips a localRotation write when the composed value is\n bit-identical to last frame \u2014 stops firing on settled fingers, dirtying every remote's finger\n subtree every frame."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
