    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Bilinearly samples one joint's rotation for a finger at the given curl/splay.\n\n Percentages outside [-1, 1] clamp to the grid edge rather than reading out of bounds:\n MediaPipe's CurlGain/SplayGain and the controller remaps can both overshoot, and the\n clamp is on the cell INDEX as well as the blend factor so an overshoot saturates instead\n of wrapping onto another finger's cells."
    Remarks: 
