  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Drivers.BasisHandPoseGrid
    MemberName: OwnsCells
    Kind: Property
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "False while Cells is a VIEW of the shared array owned by\n BasisAvatarModelCache, which is the normal state for everyone but the\n first wearer of an avatar. Only a grid that baked its own cells and never published\n them frees anything.\n \n\nEach restore used to allocate a fresh 207 KB Persistent array and rebuild all\n 13,230 quaternions element by element out of a float[] \u2014 per remote player, per avatar\n swap, for bytes identical across everyone in the same avatar. Nothing writes cells\n after the bake (every consumer only samples), so the copy bought nothing."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
