    Platforms: []
  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Drivers.BasisLegCrouchDebug
    MemberName: BasisLegCrouchDebug
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 1
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Runtime diagnostic for the leg/knee during crouch. Logs, per leg per frame, the leg-IK inputs (hip,\n foot target, knee hint) and the rendered knee, plus the \"shoot up\" signals: knee above the hip and the\n knee's per-frame position jump. Crouch up/down in VR, then Stop+Dump to see the exact inputs at the\n frame the leg flips -- crucially this includes the LIVE foot-driver knee hint, which the offline crouch\n sweep (synthetic hint) can't reproduce."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
