    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Drives per-finger poses for both hands. Bakes a 2D pose grid at init time,\n then each frame schedules one Burst job: BasisFingerSlerpJob interpolates each joint's target from the\n grid, slerps toward it and writes the transform. It was two chained jobs until the dependency fence and\n the second dispatch turned out to cost far more than the ~3 us of work in the whole chain.\n Follows the Simulate/Apply pattern used by BasisPickupSyncDriver and JigglePhysics.\n\n The grid itself now lives in BasisHandPoseGrid so remote players reconstruct fingers\n through the identical sampler; this class owns only the local player's input, smoothing and transforms.\n\n Pose grid data is cached per humanoid Avatar asset. Loading the same avatar a second\n time copies from cache instead of re-instantiating and sampling 441 poses."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
