    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: IJobParallelForTransform
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Reads the FK-posed world pose (+ local rotation) of the bones the end-effector IK needs, into\n flat buffers parallel to the skeleton TAA, and clears the per-bone override mask. Only the 12 effector\n slots (LHand/RHand/LFoot/RFoot \xD7 root/joint/tip) plus neck/head (the arm frame) of players anchored\n THIS frame do the expensive transform read \u2014 every other bone just clears its (cheap byte) mask and\n returns. Scheduled after the skeleton FK + hips-world apply so the world poses are final."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
