    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Cleans pasted or received text before it is shown, copied or shared. Line breaks become \\n;\n control characters go, tabs and line breaks excepted; so do the invisible characters that\n let what is shown differ from what is copied: direction overrides, zero-width spaces, word\n joiners, byte-order marks and tag characters. Zero-width joiners and non-joiners stay,\n because emoji sequences and several scripts need them. Unpaired surrogates are dropped, and\n combining marks past MaxCombiningMarks on one character are cut."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
