    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "What one client believes about a held prop's weld this frame.\n\n A networked hold streams the prop's offset from the holder's hand frame, so it is correct on every\n observer as long as both ends build the SAME frame \u2014 and wrong, permanently and silently, when they\n do not. The holder cannot see that: it never decodes what it sent. This is the readout that makes\n the disagreement visible, by having both ends publish the frame they actually used."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
