    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 1
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Slots allocated up front. The arrays used to be built at FixedCapacity on every client at\n boot: 65535 * BoneCount quaternions is 51 MiB per bone array, five of those plus the\n per-player and effector arrays is roughly 300 MB of Allocator.Persistent reserved before a\n single remote joined, on desktop and Android alike. Worse, the region is keyed by a\n SERVER-CHOSEN id, so a server handing out a high playerId walked EnsureInitialized across\n millions of slots on one frame and committed all of it. Capacity now tracks the ids actually\n in the room and doubles from here."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
