    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 1
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Fraction of the hearing range at which the curve starts tapering to\n zero. Purely so the hearing-range cull is silent \u2014 the source is\n hard-stopped at maxDistance and released at 1.1x that, so the curve has\n to already be inaudible there. 0.95 puts the level at the cull radius\n near -58 dB while leaving the rest of the range undistorted."
    Remarks: 
