    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Interval stamp for the next outgoing packet. While streaming it's the real elapsed time (that's the\n motion's true pacing, including distance-reduced cadences), but a quiet stretch \u2014 the last send was\n an unchanged idle keyframe, or the gap dwarfs the current cadence \u2014 is dead time, not motion. Those\n stamp the cadence instead, so remotes step across the gap rather than replaying it in real time\n (the \"grabbed pickup lags for seconds after sitting idle\" bug)."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
