  - TypeFullName: BasisTransmissionResults
    MemberName: MaxAvatarReloadsPerTick
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Max avatar (re)loads admitted per transmit tick when players cross the avatar-range boundary.\n A bulk range change (e.g. the View Range slider 0->100 at 1k players) expires every player's\n debounce on the same tick; without this cap they all call ReloadAvatar in one frame, dumping\n ~1000 bundle loads + main-thread calibrations at once. Over-budget transitions stay pending and\n commit on later ticks, ramping the crowd in over a few seconds instead of freezing."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
