    Summary: "Wall-clock ceiling on this tick's voice-source starts, mirroring\n MaxAvatarReloadMillisecondsPerTick. The count alone cannot bound the spike:\n a start that misses the object pool pays an Instantiate plus Steam Audio's native source\n creation, which is several times a pool hit."
