    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "A standalone spatialized (3D) audio source that re-emits a consented remote\n player's voice from a caller-supplied anchor transform \u2014 e.g. a radio object\n (issue #911). It mirrors BasisAnnounceAudioDriver's per-announcer source\n but is 3D and parented to the anchor, and is fed encoded frames tapped from the\n player's receiver instead of read from the network directly. It never exposes PCM\n to its creator; callers only position it via the anchor."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
