  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Networking.VoiceRecording.BasisVoiceRecording
    MemberName: BasisVoiceRecording
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 1
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Consent-gated voice capture and re-routing for remote players. A local caller asks a\n remote player for permission (StartRecording / RequestPlayFromTransform);\n once the recordee grants it, this taps the decoded voice this client already receives\n and exposes it as live PCM, an in-memory clip, a .wav file, and/or a spatialized 3D\n source (issue #911). The recordee controls consent, sees who is recording them, and can\n revoke at any time; recording auto-stops when either party leaves.\n\n This is the trusted, full-surface API. Untrusted world scripts (Cilbox) must go through\n the restricted shim, never this class directly \u2014 this exposes raw PCM and disk output."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
