  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.BasisSdk.Players.BasisAvatarNetworkLoad
    MemberName: VersionTag
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Opaque content-version tag for the bee at URL \u2014 see\n BasisRemoteEncyptedBundle.RemoteVersionTag. Lets a wearer say \"same url, new bytes\" so\n receivers can invalidate their cache for content published to a static address.\n \n\nAppended after the original two-field format shipped. Receivers must tolerate its\n absence (see DecodeFromBytes), and the server stores this payload as an\n opaque blob, so the tag reaches late joiners with no server-side change."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
