    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Forces the static constructor to run on whichever thread calls this. The field\n initializers read Application.persistentDataPath, which is main-thread-only,\n so the avatar load thread calls this from `Initialize` (on the main thread) rather\n than tripping it itself on a first Warm."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
