    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Per-player override that tells the avatar performance filter to treat this\n remote as if no limits were enabled. Set from the individual-player menu\n so the local user can look at a specific avatar at full fidelity without\n touching their global caps or the session-wide\n Basis.Scripts.Avatar.BasisAvatarPerformanceLimits.BypassAllLimits\n toggle. Resets to false every launch, every reconnect, and every fresh\n player join, so there's no accidental \"I forgot I disabled the filter for Alice\".\n Implies AvatarAlwaysLoaded: turning the filter off for one player\n is a request to see that avatar, so it also exempts them from spatial culling."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
