    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Covers the content type a dropped or pasted BEE is filed under. A world's component census\n is summed over every root in the scene, so it lists whatever props and avatars are standing\n in the world next to its BasisScene; reading that census last-one-wins filed a world holding\n a single prop under Props. The scene AssetMode on the bundle's sections is the signal that\n settles it, and only the SDK's scene build path ever writes it.\n\n The census has the same blind spot on prefab bundles, and there a build hook can create it:\n NDMF's, run over a prop, added a BasisAvatar to the build clone and every prop built with it\n installed then filed under Avatars. The ContentKind stamp names what the SDK was asked to\n build and outranks both signals; bundles built before it keep resolving off the census."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
