  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.IK.BasisNamePlateOverlayTests
    MemberName: BasisNamePlateOverlayTests
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Pins the nameplate overlay limiter policy (BasisNamePlateOverlayCore): the nearest-K\n selection that bounds how many chat bubbles / avatar-loading displays render at once,\n the loading-text quantization that stops far-too-frequent TMP re-tessellation during\n avatar downloads, and the idle-release rule that stops \"every player who ever chatted\n keeps a TMP forever\" accumulation. These rules are what keeps the overlay cost constant\n at 1000 players \u2014 a regression here silently reverts the nameplates to unbounded cost."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
