    Platforms: []
  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.IK.BasisTposeBasisTests
    MemberName: BasisTposeBasisTests
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Basis gate for the T-pose capture (BasisLocalBoneDriver.ConvertToAvatarSpaceInitial, used\n by BasisLocalAvatarDriver.SetInitialData to seed TposeLocal / TposeLocalScaled / the outgoing pose).\n\n The contract: TposeLocal is a ROOT-LOCAL offset. Everything downstream rotates it back by the root --\n the bone sim (BasisBoneSimJob's ParentMatrix), CreateRotationalLock's Offset, DriveTpose,\n BasisCalibrationMath.ComputeTposeAnchor, the seat driver's ToWorld. So the one invariant that must\n hold is a round trip:\n\n     rootPos + rootRot * TposeLocal.position  ==  the bone's world position at capture\n\n The capture used to subtract the root origin WITHOUT undoing the root rotation (the translation-only\n BasisHelpers.ConvertToLocalSpace overload) while the ROTATION beside it was properly inverse-rotated.\n That left the position in world axes, so the root rotation was applied to it a second time downstream.\n The error is exactly zero when the avatar is loaded facing world-forward -- which is how it survived --\n and grows with whatever yaw the player happened to be at when the avatar loaded or swapped. It also\n broke the spine-centreline snap in SetInitialData (`outgoingPosition.x = 0`), which is only the\n avatar's lateral axis if the offset is in avatar axes.\n\n The Legacy_* gate reproduces the old translation-only form and asserts it violates the round trip, so\n the failure mode is measured rather than remembered."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.IK.
    MemberName: AvatarLocalPoint_SurvivesTheWorldRoundTrip_AtAnyRootRotation
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
