  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.UI.NamePlate.BasisGlobalNamePlateRenderer
    MemberName: BasisGlobalNamePlateRenderer
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 1
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Merges every remote nameplate into a single panel mesh plus one text mesh per font atlas,\n so the whole lobby's name labels cost ~2 draw calls instead of ~2 per player.\n\n The merged geometry (topology + all vertex channels) is built with CombineMeshes only when\n the baked-plate set changes \u2014 a setup-time op, never per frame. Each layer is billboarded one\n of two ways:\n  - GPU (GpuBillboardPanel / GpuBillboardText): plate-local\n    positions + a per-vertex plate id are uploaded once, and each frame the CPU pushes only the\n    small per-plate matrix (+ panel color) buffers \u2014 the vertex shader does the transform.\n  - CPU (fallback): a Burst job transforms the cached local positions by the plates' current\n    matrices and pushes the position buffer with revalidation disabled.\n Hidden plates collapse to a degenerate point via a zero matrix, so visibility needs no rebuild."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
