    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Returns true when audio from this player is currently audible to the local\n user. Main-thread only \u2014 touches Unity components (audio source volume)."
    Remarks: "Covers every state that should prevent a talking pulse:\n face-visibility, failed-load pin, block state (local or remote temp),\n audio receiver presence, out-of-range (signalled by `HasAudioSource==false`,\n since Basis.Scripts.Networking.Receivers.BasisAudioReceiver.StopAudio\n fires on the out-of-range transition), and individual-player mute\n (`audioSource.volume==0`, set by `ChangeRemotePlayersVolumeSettings`).\n Continuous audio streams from speakers the user can't hear will repeatedly\n fail this check and so never latch the pulse."
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
