  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.UI.NamePlate.
    MemberName: BakeNameMeshGlobal
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 2
    ParamNames:
    - displayName
    - textTransform)
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Shared baking front-half: pushes the name through the TMP baker and computes the\n panel half-width plus the text submesh transform (horizontal flip, with a uniform\n downscale folded in when the name exceeds MaxPlateHalfWidth). The baker stays inactive\n throughout. TMP gates its Phase III vertex upload on IsActive(), so ForceMeshUpdate alone\n lays the text out into textInfo but leaves every meshInfo Mesh empty \u2014 UpdateVertexData\n performs that same upload unconditionally. Both calls are required; dropping the second\n bakes empty text meshes and the merge job dies on a missing vertex attribute."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
