    Summary: "Splits an optional `url#password` fragment off the URL. If the\n caller passed a non-empty `rawPassword`, that takes\n precedence over the fragment; otherwise the fragment is extracted as the\n password (supporting raw plaintext/hex strings and legacy base64-encoded strings).\n Used by both the in-game add dialog and the admin \"default library\" add path so the two stay in lockstep.\n \n\nWrapping quotes come off before the fragment is split, so a trailing quote on a\n pasted `\"url#pass\"` share string does not end up corrupting the password."
