  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Device_Management.Devices.
    MemberName: MergeFrom
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - other
    ParamDocs:
    - The state to merge into this one.
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "OR/max-merges another device's state into this one. Used to combine multiple devices\n that share a hand role into a single aggregated dispatch, so an edge action fires once\n for the role instead of once per device. Booleans are OR'd, triggers take the max, and\n each 2D axis takes the larger-magnitude of the two so an idle second device does not\n cancel out the active one."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
