  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.Calibration.
    MemberName: RolesClassifyIdentically_AtAnyVerticalPlayspaceOffset
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - 0f
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Runs the REAL BasisConstellationClassifier over the body with the play space dragged by\n `verticalOffset`, converting device poses to samples with the same math as\n ClassifyAndAssignTrackersFromTPose: eye height is the offset-compensated capture, the floor is\n derived from the (offset-carrying) HMD pose, ratios are body-local over eye height."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
