  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.Calibration.
    MemberName: LiftPoisonGuard_CatchesTheImpossibleEye_AndSparesRealBodies
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - flagged"
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The lift-poison guard is an absolute ceiling on the eye, never a ratio against the span. The\n first field pair (eye 1.992 / span 1.507) is a 2.14 m body and must be flagged; the second\n (eye 1.578 / span 1.182) is a 1.70 m player whose reach was measured with bent arms \u2014 there\n the SPAN is the suspect, and shrinking the eye to match it booted them as a 1.1 m player."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
