  - TypeFullName: Basis.Tests.Performance.BasisFrameClockTests
    MemberName: BasisFrameClockTests
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The shared per-frame pump that panels, mirrors and the dolly manager subscribe to instead of\n each running their own Update. It is refcounted on purpose: the moment nothing needs it, it\n stops ticking entirely rather than firing an empty event every frame, so an idle client pays\n nothing for features nobody has open.\n\n The refcount is what these tests are really about. A leaked AddRequest keeps the whole chain\n alive forever, and a double RemoveRequest would let one closed panel silence another that is\n still open."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
