    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The sweep used to fill the very arrays it had just captured the T-pose muscles into, so\n what reached the cache was the last grid cell's muscle values (curl and splay both at\n their maximum) rather than the T-pose. Nothing reads them today, which is why it went\n unnoticed; writing the muscles straight into the HumanPose leaves the capture intact."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
