    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Regression tests for the \"grabbed pickup lags for seconds after sitting idle\" bug: an idle sender's\n backed-off keyframes used to stack up as multi-second interpolation windows that playback then crossed\n in real time (capped at 1.35x), so the first motion after a grab trailed far behind the freshest\n received data before rushing to catch up. Covers the static-window skip, the gap-window clamp (with\n extrapolation suppressed across it), the idle depth-ratchet guard, and the receiver reset that\n BasisSyncedObject.OnOwnershipTransfer performs so a new owner's unrelated sequence\n numbering is accepted immediately instead of landing in the anti-reorder drop zone."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
