    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The T-pose hierarchy slot on BasisAvatarModelCache, which lets an avatar\n install replay a recorded T-pose instead of paying the animator round trip that produced it\n (two runtimeAnimatorController assignments plus a humanoid Animator.Update).\n\n This is load-bearing for the transmit tick: a player leaving avatar range installs the\n loading dummy inline there, and that dummy is one prefab shared by every remote, so the\n replay path is the one that runs after the first install in a session. A replay that put\n bones anywhere other than where the animator did would silently mis-seed everything\n calibration captures next \u2014 receiver bone data, the body-fit rest pose, jiggle roots."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
