    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "One row of the list. A linked pair is ONE row, not two. The merged virtual\n midpoint is what calibration actually binds a role to \u2014 BasisVirtualMidpointInput.Initialize\n clears the FB role off both physical halves and the classifier skips them\n (`if (input.IsLinked) continue;`), so neither half ever holds a role.\n Rendering the halves as two independent rows is why both of them sat there\n reporting \"Unassigned\" while the pair was working perfectly well."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
