    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "One visualiser layer's gizmo handles. Slots are handed out by draw order each frame and reused,\n so a layer whose element count varies between frames parks the unused tail with\n BasisGizmoManager.SetGizmoActive instead of leaking or misaligning it.\n \n\n\n Wrap a frame's drawing in Begin / End. Clear destroys\n every handle; Forget drops them without destroying, which is what a\n BasisGizmoManager.OnUseGizmosChanged master wipe needs \u2014 the manager already\n dropped those slots, so destroying them again only logs warnings."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
