    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Layer the batched sphere/line draws submit on. The calibration mirror relay points\n this at LocalPlayerAvatar while its cutout mirror is alive so gizmos show up in the\n reflection (whose camera culls to that layer), and restores it to\n DefaultRenderLayer on teardown.\n Individual gizmos can opt out with SetGizmoLayer."
    Remarks: "Resolved on first read rather than by a field initializer, for two reasons: static\n initializers run in textual order, so an initializer here would read the backing field\n below as 0 and silently settle on the Default layer; and `LayerMask.NameToLayer` is a\n Unity call that has no business running during static construction."
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
