  - TypeFullName: Basis.MediaPipe.Tests.MediaPipeArmRetargetTests
    MemberName: MediaPipeArmRetargetTests
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Ground truth for the webcam arm retarget.\n\n These landmarks are in CAMERA space, which is what the converters actually receive: the user stands in\n front of the camera FACING it, so their forward is -Z, their right hand is at -X (camera-right is the\n user's left), and their nose is nearer the camera (-Z) than their ears. Building the body the other way\n round \u2014 as if it were an avatar facing +Z \u2014 is self-consistent and hides a whole class of sign bugs,\n which is exactly how the \"arms end up behind the body\" regression slipped through.\n\n The user is a ~1.75 m person with a 0.55 m arm; the avatar is deliberately shorter with a 0.47 m arm,\n so nothing passes by accident on matched proportions."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
