    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The reported bug. The solver reads only the hint's DIRECTION in the swing plane, and that direction is\n dominated by the elbow's DEPTH \u2014 the worst number a monocular pose model produces. A depth error does\n not nudge the elbow, it rotates it around the arm, and it surfaces as the elbow riding up."
