    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "An output plays through a BasisMediaPlayerAudioTap, which\n generates the stream into the AudioSource's DSP block. Unity runs filters\n in component order, so a tap below them (or a missing one, which is appended\n when added at runtime) leaves every filter above it processing silence. Shared by\n the audio and tap inspectors, which both offer to put the tap back on top."
    Remarks: 
