  - TypeFullName: BasisMediaSmokeTest
    MemberName: BasisMediaSmokeTest
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Plays a source end to end and grades the run against the documented\n bands, so \"does it still work\" is a command rather than a person\n watching a quad.\n\n Interactive: `Basis > Tools > Media Player > Run Smoke Test`.\n\n Batch:\n ```\n\n Unity -batchmode -projectPath <project> -logFile - \\\n       -executeMethod BasisMediaSmokeTest.RunBatch\n \n```\n with optional environment: `BASIS_SMOKE_URL` (defaults to the\n repo fixture), `BASIS_SMOKE_SECONDS`, `BASIS_SMOKE_STRICT_HOLDS`,\n `BASIS_SMOKE_LIVE` (a live source is not expected to end).\n Exit code 0 on a pass, 1 on a fail, so CI reads it directly.\n\n Entering play mode reloads the domain, so the run's state lives in\n SessionState and the timer re-hooks itself on the far\n side."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
