    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Drain pending SEI user-data messages: records into\n `records` (up to `capacity`),\n their payloads packed into `bytes` (up to\n `bytesCapacity`), each record's Offset/Len locating\n its payload. Returns the record count. Only whole messages that fit\n are taken; the rest wait. A message whose payload alone exceeds\n bytesCapacity is dropped, so size bytes to at least the engine's\n 64 KiB per-message ceiling to see everything."
    Remarks: 
