  - TypeFullName: BasisMediaPlayer
    MemberName: BasisMediaPlayer
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: MonoBehaviour
    Interfaces:
    - IBasisPcmSource
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 1
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Playback component over the basis_media engine (ABI v4; Direct3D 11 or 12 on\n Windows, Vulkan on Android).\n\n Poll-driven: one snapshot per frame, one render event per frame once\n the video texture exists, and the decoded audio ring offered as an\n IBasisPcmSource.\n\n It draws nothing on its own. The video texture reaches the world through\n an output sink (BasisVideoMaterialOutput for a renderer,\n BasisVideoDisplay for a uGUI RawImage), which owns aspect,\n projection, stereo eye and the frame-origin correction.\n\n It makes no sound on its own. Audio belongs to\n BasisMediaPlayerAudio on the same GameObject, which\n broadcasts this ring to one AudioSource per speaker, so each channel can\n be positioned, spatialised and filtered independently. Without one, the\n session decodes audio that nothing consumes."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
