    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Re-open the current source where it is, so a setting the\n engine only reads at open takes effect now. Costs a short re-buffer;\n a live source rejoins the edge because it has nothing to return to.\n The same load on a new session: it re-opens the stream the session\n is already on rather than routing through the resolver again, keeps\n what the load knows (the URL asked for, a resolver's answer, the\n audio track and subtitle choices, a pause), does not move\n LoadGeneration,\n and so is not a new load to shared playback: nobody else's playback\n moves because of it."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
