    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The model is trained to emit calibrated per-viseme weights, so all that is left\n to do is smooth them.\n\n The previous build ran a hand-tuned \"suppress silence, boost speech by up to 3x,\n renormalize\" pass here. That existed only to rescue a model whose outputs were\n saturated by being fed unnormalized features; with the feature contract fixed it\n is actively harmful, because it distorts exactly the graded weights that drive\n blendshape blending. It is gone."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
