    Summary: "Loads the real controller model for the active OpenXR runtime at runtime through Valve's\n `XR_EXT_render_model` feature (glTF binary imported with glTFast), so controllers render as\n their physical geometry instead of the generic sphere fallback. Only runtimes implementing the\n render-model extensions (SteamVR / Steam Frame) return a model; elsewhere the owner keeps its\n baked/sphere fallback. Requires the `com.unity.cloud.gltfast` package."
