    Summary: "One-shot frame capture. Pulls full hierarchical sample data for every\n recorded thread of the most recent frame via ProfilerDriver +\n RawFrameDataView, plus FrameTimingManager CPU/GPU numbers, plus the\n existing Basis network counters and BasisEventDriverProfilerData\n fields. Writes:\n   ProfilerCaptures/frame_<ts>.json  \u2013 full per-thread sample tree\n   ProfilerCaptures/frame_<ts>.md    \u2013 human-readable digest (clipboard too)\n   ProfilerCaptures/frame_<ts>.data  \u2013 native Profiler trace, loadable in Profiler window"
