    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: Fills an array with the same value.
    Remarks: "The range is clamped to the array rather than trusted. The write goes through a raw\n pointer, so `startIndex + length` past the end used to run off the block with no\n bounds check in any build \u2014 Assert is compiled out of players and only\n logs in the editor, so nothing stopped it. This is public SDK surface reachable from\n world and avatar scripts, which makes an unclamped length a memory-safety hole, not\n just a caller bug."
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames:
