    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Avatar-wide lip-sync response settings.\n \n\nEvery field's \"absent\" value is also a legal authored value \u2014 most dangerously\n BackendSmoothing, where 0 means \"no smoothing whatsoever\" \u2014 so an instance\n that reaches the runtime without its field initialisers having run is indistinguishable\n from a deliberate request for silence. Consumers must test IsUnset before\n honouring a config rather than assuming the initialisers below always apply."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
