  - TypeFullName: BasisValidationAssetCache
    MemberName: BasisValidationAssetCache
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Editor-lifetime cache for the AssetDatabase work the SDK validators would otherwise repeat on\n every pass.\n\n \n\nThe validators resolve an asset path and an importer for every texture and every mesh they\n look at. Both walk the asset database, and `AssetImporter.GetAtPath` deserializes the\n `.meta` behind it, which is why an avatar with a few dozen textures made its own inspector\n the most expensive thing on screen.\n\n\n\nEverything here is dropped wholesale the moment anything is imported, moved or deleted \u2014\n including by the validators' own auto-fixes, which reimport \u2014 so a stale importer is never\n handed out. Invalidated lets open inspectors know they should look again."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
