  - TypeFullName: BasisValidationHierarchyScan
    MemberName: BasisValidationHierarchyScan
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 1
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "One walk of the content hierarchy, shared by every check in a pass.\n\n \n\nEach check used to do its own `GetComponentsInChildren` \u2014 a fresh array per call, per\n check \u2014 and then filter it with LINQ. On a dense avatar that is several thousand components\n copied per pass before a single thing has been validated. This walks once, keeps its lists, and\n hands them out.\n\n\n\nAll includes EditorOnly objects because a missing script has to be reported\n wherever it is; Active excludes EditorOnly subtrees because nothing under one\n reaches the upload, so its meshes and textures are none of the validator's business."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
