  - TypeFullName: Basis.Network.Core.Compression.BasisAvatarBundleCodec
    MemberName: BasisAvatarBundleCodec
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Reader for the compressed-avatar-bundle body carried on\n BasisNetworkCommons.CompressedAvatarBundleChannel.\n\n The server writes the body grouped by channel (BasisServerReductionSystemEvents.BuildRawForRange):\n ```\n\n   group*  where group := [origChannel:1][n:1][msgLen:2-LE] x n [bodies]\n \n```\n with the DeltaAvatarChannel group's bodies column-transposed \u2014 byte j of every body, then\n byte j+1 of every body \u2014 because delta bodies are short and field-aligned, so interleaving\n puts the same field from different players adjacent and gives LZ4 something to match.\n\n Three places consume this: the Unity client handler, and the console load-tester's sniffer\n in each server tree. Rather than triplicate the un-transpose, TryFlatten\n rewrites a grouped body into the flat, ungrouped\n `[origChannel:1][msgLen:2-LE][body]*` stream those callers already know how to walk."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
