    Summary: "Classifies a grouped bundle body by traffic class, walking only the group headers \u2014\n it never touches the bodies, so it is far cheaper than TryFlatten.\n\n `deltaOnly` is true when every group is\n BasisNetworkCommons.DeltaAvatarChannel. That is the split the hybrid\n codec routes on: delta-only bundles go to LZ4, anything carrying a keyframe/full\n quality channel goes to dictionary Zstd. See BasisAvatarBundleZstd.\n\n Returns false on a malformed body, in which case `deltaOnly` is\n meaningless and the caller should drop the bundle."
