    Summary: "The Zstd dictionary both ends of BasisAvatarBundleZstd compress against.\n\n \u26A0\uFE0F GENERATED by BundleDictionaryTrainer.TrainFromCaptureFile \u2014 do not hand-edit.\n Server and client must hold byte-identical content: frames are written with the\n dictionary id suppressed, so a mismatch is not caught by zstd itself. The generation\n below travels in the bundle flags byte, and a decoder that does not hold it drops the\n bundle rather than decoding it against the wrong dictionary.\n\n Trained on 16384 bytes. Holdout measurement at training time:\n   lz4 ratio 0.8944, zstd ratio 0.7682, saving vs lz4 14.11%."
