    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The channel decomposition of one quality's avatar payload, grouped into the same dirty-mask\n fields BasisAvatarDeltaCompression has always used.\n\n The channel list is a TOTAL PARTITION of the payload: every bit belongs to exactly one\n channel, structural padding included. That is what lets both codecs rebuild a payload\n byte-for-byte from channel values alone, rather than having to fall back on copying\n unmodelled regions."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
