    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 1
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Which 8-byte words of the payload each field has bits in, one bit per word.\n\n \n\nThis is what lets the delta encoder rule a field out without unpacking it: AND this\n against BasisPayloadDiff.WordDiffMask and a zero result proves every bit the\n field owns is unchanged, because all of them lie inside words that compared equal. A\n non-zero result proves nothing \u2014 fields share words \u2014 so the caller still runs the exact\n per-channel comparison on whatever survives, and the emitted delta is unchanged."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
