    Summary: "One slice of the sweep: receivers `[SliceStart, SliceEnd)` of a roster of\n PlayerCount, measured against every player in that roster.\n\n \n\nPositions are dense and in roster order rather than indexed by peer id. The server's\n own arrays are keyed by peer id and therefore full of holes; compacting once on the way in\n costs one pass and removes the holes from the transfer and the kernel both."
