    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Most loaded resources (props/worlds spawned via LoadResource) one player may hold at once.\n Each retained entry keeps the resource's URL and metadata in server RAM and is rebroadcast to\n every client, so an uncapped client can exhaust memory and flood the relay. Sized well above\n normal heavy use (thousands per player); raise it for instances that legitimately hold more.\n 0 or negative restores the default rather than removing the cap."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
