  - TypeFullName: Basis.Network.Core.BasisBoundedStream
    MemberName: BasisBoundedStream
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Reads a decompression stream to its end while refusing to buffer more than the protocol\n says the payload may be.\n\n Deflate and Brotli both reach ratios in the thousands on repetitive input, and the frame's\n declared length is the COMPRESSED length, so a receiver cannot know the real size before it\n starts copying. Stream.CopyTo has no ceiling at all, which is what makes a few kilobytes on\n the wire able to ask for gigabytes of heap."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
