    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Sizes a per-thread-contention structure \u2014 stripe tables, shard counts, pools whose only\n job is to keep concurrent threads off each other's cache lines.\n\n Always derived, never a literal. Hosts this runs on range from a couple of container\n vCPUs to hundreds of cores, and a constant picked on one of them is wrong everywhere\n else in a way that never shows up as an error \u2014 just contention nobody attributes. The\n result is rounded up to a power of two so callers can index it with a mask."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
