    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The peak carried into the next eligibility check. Only a pass that actually emptied the\n server may lower it \u2014 a pass that merely thinned the crowd must not rebase the bar down\n to the reduced population, or a population that recedes in stages rather than hitting\n zero in one shot can permanently duck under 1/4 of a peak that no longer reflects\n reality. That is what let one production spike (2379 -> 24 players, 14.2 GB working set)\n sit unreclaimed for the rest of that run."
