    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "The last pose the room was told about, or null while the picture has not moved since\n it was shared. A spawn header says where a picture was *put*; anybody may then pick it\n up and carry it off, and a joiner handed the header alone is shown the empty spot it\n was created in. Retained verbatim like every other payload, so replaying it needs no\n new receive code - and it carries scale, which a spawn header does not."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
