    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Remembers where a picture has got to. Taken from whoever sent it rather than from the\n owner alone, because control of a card passes to whoever picks it up, so the player\n moving one is very often not the player who shared it. That is no wider a trust surface\n than it appears: the relay has already handed these exact bytes to the whole room, and\n all the cache does is keep what everybody has already been told."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
