    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Removes all subscriptions and handlers for the normalized address. This is the \"remove everything for this address\"\n variant: unlike Unsubscribe(string, OscMessageEvent), which removes a single handler through\n RemoveCallback{TDelegate}(TDelegate, TDelegate), this overload clears the full address entry and all delegates\n that were previously added through AddCallback{TDelegate}(TDelegate, TDelegate).\n When RemoveCallback{TDelegate}(TDelegate, TDelegate) receives a null callback it also removes that callback type,\n which is the same \"remove all\" behavior exposed intentionally by Unsubscribe(string)."
    Remarks: 
