    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Web requests for world and prop scripts. Pass `this` so Basis knows which content is\n asking. The player approves the script once (Script Permissions) and then each site it\n contacts; until then the callback gets NotAllowed or Declined and the rest of the script\n runs. https only, default port, host names only, nothing on the local network. Uploads up\n to 256 KB, downloads up to 4 MB, 15 s timeout, 4 at a time and 30 a minute per content.\n The callback gets the result, the HTTP status code (0 when none) and the response body."
    Remarks: 
