    Summary: "Teaches the Basis API Reference about the sandbox.\n\n \n\nThe reference lives in com.basis.framework.editor and has no idea Cilbox exists; this\n registers itself into its provider hook at editor load, so the reference gains a Cilbox\n section only in projects that actually have the shims. Every verdict comes from\n BasisCilboxPermissionModel, which calls the sandboxes' own check methods \u2014\n a member cannot read as allowed here and be refused at load."
