    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Whether a named member on a named type is reachable, without needing the\n MethodBase. Used by the API reference, where the point is to say \"this\n call works in the avatar box but not the prop box\" for a call written as text.\n\n \n\nChecking the type alone is not enough: `Basis.Shims.*` puts every shim into\n the prop and scene boxes by wildcard, and those two then pin some of them shut with an\n empty method set. A type-only check would advertise scripted player input to prop\n authors, where every one of its methods is refused."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
