  - TypeFullName: Basis.Shims.Editor.BasisCilboxPermissionSource
    MemberName: BasisCilboxPermissionSource
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Reads and rewrites the whitelist collections that live as `static readonly` fields in\n `CilboxBasisCommon` / `CilboxAvatarBasis` / `CilboxPropBasis` /\n `CilboxSceneBasis`.\n\n \n\nThese lists are the sandbox boundary, so the rules here are deliberately timid. The\n parser only ever understands the shapes those four files actually use; anything it cannot\n reproduce character-for-character is reported as read-only and left to be edited by hand.\n Every write re-renders the unmodified parse first and refuses to continue unless it\n matches the file on disk exactly, so a formatting style the parser does not know about\n causes an edit to be declined rather than a whitelist to be silently rewritten."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
